ation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>On the mountains west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Island%20of%20Destiny\">Island of Destiny</a> (sorcerer's hut roof) and a small island north-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This object has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>It was possible to enchant <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethysts</a> on it by <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> of level 30 or higher until Summer Update 2017.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Charles\">Charles</a></li><li>Constructions</li><li>Energy Archway</li><li>Illumination</li><li>Navigation</li><li>Shrines and Altars</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["threatened-dreams-quest"]}